      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I will add that I would like to see some more AVPro stuff exposed to Udon as well.\nMy use case is I want to be able to collect all components of VRCAVProVideoSpeaker and VRCAVProVideoScreen types within a given context and filter out any speakers and screens that aren't pointing at the target player.\nTo accomplish this, the bare minimum I'd need is for the VideoPlayer property on both types to be exposed in udon so I can do the check.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
